===========================================

In order to get working your ibuddy you need to install and run, before start jabbim, the pybuddy server.
You can get Pybuddy at http://code.google.com/p/pybuddy/

Once you have started src/pybuddy-daemon.py you are ready to use your ibuddy starting jabbim and selecting this plugin. You can edit the file ibuddy.py in order to change the colors of the toy.

Please send comments to leandro@leandro.org (email & jid)
